00:02:57.651 --> 00:03:01.372
<v Host>It means to open — it is also used for holding an event.

00:03:01.972 --> 00:03:13.876
<v Slow>スプリームクラスには、二つのタイプがあります。個室の「キャビン」と、半個室の「シート」です。

00:03:14.675 --> 00:03:21.467
<v Host>Supreme Class has two types: a fully private room called Cabin, and a semi-private type called Seat.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.300
