00:03:24.699 --> 00:03:26.548
<v Host>It means a private room.

00:03:27.147 --> 00:03:34.707
<v Slow>半個室の「シート」は、10号車に、6席だけあります。

00:03:35.508 --> 00:03:40.331
<v Host>The semi-private type has only six seats, all in car number ten.

00:03:40.931 --> 00:03:43.044
<v Vocab>席

00:03:43.443 --> 00:03:44.955
<v Host>It means a seat.

00:03:45.556 --> 00:03:56.379
<v Slow>席のまわりには、大きな壁があります。静かに、ゆっくり休むことができます。

00:03:57.180 --> 00:04:02.364
<v Host>Around each seat there are big walls, so you can rest quietly and slowly.

00:04:02.963 --> 00:04:05.195
