00:04:05.596 --> 00:04:07.180
<v Host>It means quiet.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:20.283
<v Slow>タブレットで、明かりやエアコンを、自分で変えることができます。飲み物やお菓子のサービスもあります。

00:04:21.084 --> 00:04:28.644
<v Host>With a tablet, you can change the lights and the air conditioning yourself. There is also a drink and snack service.

00:04:29.244 --> 00:04:31.403
