00:04:31.803 --> 00:04:33.891
<v Host>It means to change something.

00:04:34.492 --> 00:04:49.755
<v Slow>個室の「キャビン」は、今年の10月1日から始まります。東京から新大阪まで、値段は4万2100円です。

00:04:50.555 --> 00:04:59.603
<v Host>The private rooms start on October first this year. From Tokyo to Shin-Osaka, the price is forty-two thousand one hundred yen.

00:05:00.204 --> 00:05:02.291
<v Vocab>値段

00:05:02.692 --> 00:05:04.324
<v Host>It means price.

00:05:04.923 --> 00:05:18.339
<v Slow>半個室の「シート」は、来年度に始まる予定です。イベントは人気で、予約はすぐにいっぱいになりました。

00:05:19.139 --> 00:05:26.795
<v Host>The semi-private seats are planned to start next fiscal year. The event is popular — reservations filled up right away.

00:05:27.396 --> 00:05:29.675
<v Vocab>予約

00:05:30.076 --> 00:05:34.348
<v Host>It means a reservation — booking a seat or a place before you go.

